### List products (GraphQL)
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "{ products { id name price stock category } }" }

### Get product by id (GraphQL)
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "query($id:Int!){ product(id:$id){ id name description price stock category createdAt updatedAt } }", "variables": { "id": 1 } }

### Create product (GraphQL)
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "mutation($input:CreateProductInput!){ createProduct(input:$input){ id name price stock } }", "variables": { "input": { "name": "Wireless Mouse", "description": "Ergonomic wireless mouse", "price": 29.99, "stock": 100, "category": "Electronics" } } }

### Update product (GraphQL)
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "mutation{ updateProduct(id:1, input:{ price: 24.99, stock: 80 }){ id name price stock updatedAt } }" }

### Delete product (GraphQL)
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "mutation{ deleteProduct(id:1) }" }

